| `check_W` effect labels | Refuses an annotated make target without a well-formed effect label, a `[write]` recipe that does not open with `$(WRITE_GUARD)`, a `WRITE_GUARD` that does not open with the clause that stops make under `-i`, and any `.IGNORE` rule. | `make check` | [`make_targets.write_shapes`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | A label is a claim; `tests/integration/test_make_target_effects.py` measures it. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
